==Event Information==
Lunar New Year Campaign

On from January 17th through February 6th!

Clear the Lunar New Year map's "Joy and Prosperity" stage in The Battle Cats, then post a screenshot of the victory screen as a comment under this post to enter the contest! (See our example in the comments!)

After the contest ends on February 6th, 2022, one lucky entrant will be randomly chosen to win the Grand Prize of 7,777 Cat Food! 10 more winners will get randomly picked to earn a present of 777 Cat Food!

Plus, if total number of Likes and Comments reaches 7777, all players will get one Rare Ticket at the end of the campaign!

※ Be aware that once the Lunar New Year map has been cleared once in a day, it will not appear again until the following day.

